  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "きょじん　でんせつについて\nピオニーが　まとめた　メモ。\nこせいてきな　えが　かかれている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "거인의 전설에 대해\n피오니가 정리한 메모.\n개성적인 그림이 그려져 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "皮歐尼針對巨人傳說\n所整理的筆記。\n上面畫有個性十足的圖案。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Les notes de Dhilan sur les colosses légendaires.\nIl a pris le temps de les accompagner d’illustrations.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Gesammelte Notizen von Peony über die Legende der\nGiganten. Ein paar einzigartige Illustrationen sind\nauch dabei.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una nota escrita por Peony acerca de la leyenda de los\ngigantes. Contiene unas ilustraciones muy particulares.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Appunti presi da Peony sulla leggenda dei giganti.\nContengono un’illustrazione singolare.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A clue about the legend of giants. It’s written\nby Peony and has unique drawings.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "巨人　伝説について\nピオニーが　まとめた　メモ。\n個性的な　絵が　描かれている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "皮欧尼整理的\n有关巨人传说的笔记。\n上面绘有充满个性的画。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una nota escrita por Peony acerca de la leyenda de los\ngigantes. Contiene unas ilustraciones muy particulares.",
